    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndūhū ngofyoolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya Nomeeji, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Daūdi, ūyo walī ntemi mu Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Na a masala gatī na ngofyoolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene Nomeeji naalī ntemi wa Baisilaeli mu Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naalī nifunya mu būshikanu bose kūtūmamīla masala, nīlole mu welwa ng'holò, na kwīgīsīlīja pyī īyo īkīītagwa ha sīlīlī y'igūlū. Ū Mulungu abahelelile nigo ndito no a banhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nībona pyī īyo īkīītagwa ha sīlīlī ya līīmi, ndūhū mo gete ū gwa kūsola, īlī gītī kūpeeja lūyaga dūhū!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nandya kwiganika nakwiwīlaga, “Yū ūlū a masala dūhū, a gene naagabbakīgije; nīyo kūbaheeba pye abo baalī basugile ū mu Yelusalemu aho nataalī kūbiza ho ū nene. Na a maganiko gane gīībītīlile mingī no, nose ī haha nalī na masala na witegeleja būtaale kīngī nasho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nandya kwideedeng'hanya ū mu maganiko gane nagamane ūmo galī a masala, nū lūtūgà, nū būbbūūlī. Alīyo nūbona gīkī, nū gwenūyū nago gūtikīlile na kūpeeja lūyaga!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
